his fantastic mat has made our trip to Lake Argyle Caravan Park much cleaner than other places we have visited. The excellent threads make it much cleaner than any other mat I have used.\"","text_size":110,"customer_name":"Kay B.","block_color":"#ededea","text_color":"text-dark"}},"image_GRVmtz":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"star_rating":5,"enable_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_12-2.jpg","aspect_ratio":0.9,"heading":"“This mat works works an absolute treat! Great Quality!”","text_size":110,"customer_name":"Chase","block_color":"#ededea","text_color":"text-dark"}},"image_Ub8nan":{"type":"image","disabled":true,"settings":{"star_rating":5,"enable_border":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_12-3.jpg","aspect_ratio":0.9,"heading":"\"What can I say, this mat is the duck's guts. So nice under foot and no sand or crap comes through from the bottom. Very well made with quality material\".","text_size":110,"customer_name":"Andrew","block_color":"#ededea","text_color":"text-dark"}},"image_cdKCfJ":{"type":"image","repeater":"{{ product.metafields.custom.product_reviews.value }}","settings":{"star_rating":5,"enable_border":true,"image":"{{ block.repeater.image.value }}","aspect_ratio":0.8,"heading":"{{ block.repeater.heading.value }}","text_size":125,"customer_name":"{{ block.repeater.customer_name.value }}","block_color":"#ededea","text_color":"text-dark"}}},"block_order":["image_nfhYk9","image_AgKUKQ","image_GRVmtz","image_Ub8nan","image_cdKCfJ"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"subheading":"Hear the word from out Yonder.","subheading_size":100,"title":"Real reviews. Real people. Real good.","heading_size":100,"text_alignment":"text-left","bg_color":"","testimonial_block_color":"","star_color":"#8bac0e","testimonial_text_color":"text-dark","width":"wrapper--full-padded","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":80}},"14799a60-0c01-42df-b31a-f2d6a12cefa5":{"type":"section-text","blocks":{"template--15169561329737__14799a60-0c01-42df-b31a-f2d6a12cefa5-16862002943d1a394e-0":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.sub_heading_features_.value }}<\/p>","size":100,"margin_bottom":16}},"template--15169561329737__14799a60-0c01-42df-b31a-f2d6a12cefa5-16862002943d1a394e-1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.heading_the_bells_whistles_.value }}<\/p>","size":100,"heading_highlight_type":"italics","highlight_color":"#d43747","highlight_text_color":"#000000"}}},"block_order":["template--15169561329737__14799a60-0c01-42df-b31a-f2d6a12cefa5-16862002943d1a394e-0","template--15169561329737__14799a60-0c01-42df-b31a-f2d6a12cefa5-16862002943d1a394e-1"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"text_position":"center","bg_color_secondary":true,"text_color":"text-dark","width":"wrapper--narrow","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_columns_eYw8D8":{"type":"section-columns","blocks":{"text_block_DKz8T9":{"type":"text_block","repeater":"{{ product.metafields.custom.key_benefits_items.value }}","settings":{"image":"{{ block.repeater.image.value }}","title":"{{ block.repeater.heading.value }}","text":"<p>{{ block.repeater.text | metafield_tag }}<\/p>","button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--text","button_size":"btn--small","video_link_popup":"","video_link_color":"text-dark"}}},"block_order":["text_block_DKz8T9"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"text-left","columns":3,"columns_mobile":"1","show_images":true,"show_borders":false,"equalize_height":true,"desktop_aspect_ratio":0.8,"mobile_aspect_ratio":0.8,"heading_size":150,"text_size":100,"bg_color_secondary":true,"color_borders":"#000000","layout_mobile":"carousel","width":"wrapper--full-padded","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":60}},"tabs":{"type":"section-accordions","blocks":{"acordion-0":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"What is a Multimat?","text":"<p>The Multimat is a dual layer dust abatement mat that stops dust and dirt transfer from the outside to the inside of your tent, caravan or camper trailer.<\/p>"}},"94e75911-f75d-405b-8226-1c2f65643a4c":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"What Is Multimat made from?","text":"<p>Multimat is made from high density polypropylene, knitted mono\/mono and fully bound all the way around the mat and peg pointed approximately every half metre.<\/p>"}},"811ba464-11c9-4282-bf18-5e7cf1e2ee9b":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Why doesn’t the sand rise to the top of the Multimat?","text":"<p>This is due to the dual layers and the law of gravity. The sand and dirt won’t rise to the top of the multimat because the multiple layers create maximum resistance. This stops sand and dirt transferring into the tent, caravan or camper trailer unlike a single layer mat which has no resistance.<\/p>"}},"acordion-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Can I put pegs through the mats?","text":"<p>Tent pegs can be pegged into multimat, but not designed to be pegged. The mat material has rip stop technology so it won’t tear or fray if you put a hole in it.<\/p>"}},"b48aea37-98e6-40b5-af34-46d7eff5c646":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Do I have to peg the Multimat down to the ground?","text":"<p>Multimat is designed to be pegged at all dring’s for maximum efficiency.<\/p>"}},"acordion-2":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Do you include a warranty?","text":"<p>Multimat has a 12 month warranty from the date of purchase. This is a manufacturer’s warranty eg faulty sewing or material. Faulty products should be returned to the place of purchase together with a copy of the original receipt.<\/p>"}},"80eb8a84-90e9-4ac2-b3a5-5d6d1e72e12a":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Will camp furniture damage the Multimat?","text":"<p>All good camp furniture have leg protectors or loop legs to protect mat from damage. If legs have plastic protectors, these need to be replaced with rubber protectors to stop sliding.<\/p>"}},"f649e455-3a9f-4927-9afe-355d6eb19d5c":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Will mud ruin the mat?","text":"<p>From our experience, the same principle applies to mud not rising through to the top layer. Mud left on top of the Multimat will dry out, return to dust and dissipate through the Multimat back to the ground.<\/p>"}},"e7982ff6-a9b8-40c7-8ded-f32b3b20a28d":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Does it matter what side of the Multimat you use?","text":"<p>Multimat is fully reversible therefore can be used either green or grey side face up.<\/p>"}},"2fb093fd-5f24-4496-b5e8-da6e57781731":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Does the sand and dust get caught between the Multimat layers?","text":"<p>Dust, dirt or sand particles will not get trapped between the layers, it has been designed to fall through the top layer, then the second layer and onto the ground.<\/p>"}},"text_CkmaNh":{"type":"text","repeater":"{{ product.metafields.custom.faqs.value }}","settings":{"title":"{{ block.repeater.heading.value }}","text":"{{ block.repeater.text | metafield_tag }}"}}},"block_order":["acordion-0","94e75911-f75d-405b-8226-1c2f65643a4c","811ba464-11c9-4282-bf18-5e7cf1e2ee9b","acordion-1","b48aea37-98e6-40b5-af34-46d7eff5c646","acordion-2","80eb8a84-90e9-4ac2-b3a5-5d6d1e72e12a","f649e455-3a9f-4927-9afe-355d6eb19d5c","e7982ff6-a9b8-40c7-8ded-f32b3b20a28d","2fb093fd-5f24-4496-b5e8-da6e57781731","text_CkmaNh"],"settings":{"layout":"two-columns","show_accordion_divider":true,"title":"FAQs","subheading":"","text":"","tabs_bg_color":"#fafafa","bg_color_secondary":false,"text_color":"text-dark","width":"wrapper--full-padded","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"1e732b75-7029-49b1-b9ce-6fdda8f21f9d":{"type":"section-text","blocks":{"template--15169561329737__1e732b75-7029-49b1-b9ce-6fdda8f21f9d-16861964878ecb53f5-2":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Can't find what you're looking for? View our full list of FAQs below.<\